      },
      "verification": {
        "verified": true,
        "reason": "valid",
        "payload": "tree e438899483f43fee53aeaf142047091b159dbc8c\nparent 794a753958a7d4c03d6deadd6740d32d9bd6dbb5\nauthor Hennadii Stepanov <32963518+hebasto@users.noreply.github.com> 1787663230 +0100\ncommitter Hennadii Stepanov <32963518+hebasto@users.noreply.github.com> 1787663815 +0100\n\nqa: Reduce `-maxconnections` in the functional test framework\n\nSince bitcoin/bitcoin#35730 the HTTP server reserves file descriptors\nfor its listen sockets and for `-rpcmaxconnections` connected clients\n(16 by default), so `min_required_fds` in init.cpp grew.\n\nOn select()-based platforms `available_fds` is capped at FD_SETSIZE,\nwhich is 256 on NetBSD. The previous value of 94 no longer fits and\nevery node in the test suite started up with a warning, which the\nframework treats as unexpected stderr and fails on.\n\nRecompute the value with the new accounting (256 - 179 = 77) and\nupdate the comment to match the current variable names in init.cpp.\n",
        "signature": "-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niQIzBAABCgAdFiEE0dvyxLlvLev0wWZUQQEIES5+qB8FAmqNlccACgkQQQEIES5+\nqB92rA//e/0dEzohAR8rxtWx8u//IyyqRfMFPEY6TFDWjsZoom+I1r4OW5mFlbuC\nWwShxZv3GGZ1bxAaL6ovFA04CL4oPt0FHBaSglplquV4UfODo9j9ptRsvCCvTMIg\nRNvOnphAbGbynUYUPWWQ+4lmEFbjEdWifIR2YeeK98M1LvFZnuZ7JVz+LMQ5iGro\nv+9sP2ADFDmmAjMc3rtkO7/5MInQABSWuCVytzeEb1Iib8eOPN6xxcL0DXs7Qh/E\nwTvO+sA2LRAvKFvcdb1WperxRkZVZEFC3zH6cT/i+TrEJSCPI5j9y0QdT+SH8XYY\nboXLtFYHWCBqjut5lfdqjepp2gp0DZLBEieReO7FPckjLjGkR8d6VbZTjvQEnH/S\nv8Olsu3S+n12DoYX55VZP115zIBibqmdqTSkHL7QZ3PsAkRP5T2DI/UkO57JBhF9\nEqWjRxo/eIK6PIRAZKldbNIv6B93nY8lhcHgtDO5bCDcAJLRzy7ixn8vMvzDNZwP\njPHdNpb4mWwexD3R6WV3nkgIm/5pCstAT8Dcr+ovR/FLthQc32PXKBmnAU1mNana\nduusXsMq6Bx5ww55xcdPfIw/OPSS1uGcggJrgqMfSxP7+Xc8nzD+QS3I7Gc2Tlo/\ni6WJ6GDKjJAZKaUajuHLrBatcLGBxau39fYTN9MEOPtBZFOiU6U=\n=IOGV\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----"
